### RSS Content Analyzer - RSS Feeds API Tests
### You can use this file with REST Client extension in VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### List all feeds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List active feeds only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds?is_active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List feeds with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get single feed by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds/FEED_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create new feed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/rss",
  "name": "Hacker News",
  "description": "Tech news and startups",
  "is_active": true
}

### Update feed
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds/FEED_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hacker News - Updated",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### Toggle feed active status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds/FEED_ID_HERE/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete feed
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds/FEED_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test feed URL (without saving)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/rss"
}

### Bulk import feeds
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds/bulk-import
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "feeds": [
    {
      "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/rss",
      "name": "Hacker News",
      "description": "Tech news"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://rss.nytimes.com/services/xml/rss/nyt/Technology.xml",
      "name": "NYT Technology",
      "description": "New York Times tech section"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/news/technology/rss.xml",
      "name": "BBC Tech",
      "description": "BBC technology news"
    }
  ]
}

### Export feeds to CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds/export/csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
# Example curl commands:
#
# List feeds:
# curl http://localhost:3001/api/feeds \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN"
#
# Create feed:
# curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/feeds \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
#   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#   -d '{"url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/rss","name":"Hacker News"}'
#
# Test feed:
# curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/feeds/test \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
#   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#   -d '{"url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/rss"}'
